box fr_got|$m_out
box fr_want|1
box fr_next|f_ad_oddnot
jump fcheck|m

premark f_ad_oddnot
box m_op|isodd
box m_a|6
umload require|advmath|f_ad_oddn1
premark f_ad_oddn1
box fr_name|adv-iseven-not
box fr_got|$m_out
box fr_want|0
box fr_next|f_ad_neg
