premark f_ad_max
box m_op|max2
box m_a|3
box m_b|7
umload require|advmath|f_ad_max1
premark f_ad_max1
box fr_name|adv-max2
box fr_got|$m_out
box fr_want|7
box fr_next|f_ad_mod
jump fcheck|m

premark f_ad_mod
box m_op|mod2
box m_a|14
box m_b|3
umload require|advmath|f_ad_mod1
premark f_ad_mod1
box fr_name|adv-mod2
box fr_got|$m_out
box fr_want|2
box fr_next|f_ad_sign
