premark f_ad_signz
box m_op|signv
box m_a|0
umload require|advmath|f_ad_signz1
premark f_ad_signz1
box fr_name|adv-sign-zero
box fr_got|$m_out
box fr_want|0
box fr_next|f_ad_clamp_lo
